TITLE Scenario 8001: pH=7.5, High, NTA=300mg/L, Clay, Wet, Ionic=High
SOLUTION 1  RI contaminated soil pore water
    temp      25
    pH        7.5
    pe        3
    units     mol/L
    # Heavy metals
    Pb        1.4479e-03  # 300 mg/L
    Cu        3.9339e-03  # 250 mg/L
    Zn        6.1181e-03  # 400 mg/L
    Cd        2.2240e-04  # 25 mg/L
    # Competing cations
    Ca        4.9900e-04  # 20 mg/L
    Mg        4.1135e-04  # 10 mg/L
    # Ionic strength (salinity)
    Na        8.6994e-02  # 2000 mg/L
    Cl        8.4626e-02  # 3000 mg/L
    # Dissolved organic carbon
    C(4)      1.9305e-04  # 40 mg/L base DOC
    Nta       1.5695e-03  # 300 mg/L NTA
    
SURFACE 1  Soil mineral surfaces (Fe/Al oxides)
    Hfo_wOH   1.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
